":"53"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"42"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Saber is Shirou's Servant. Loyal, independent, and reserved, Saber acts coldly but is actually suppressing her emotions to focus on her goals."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her class is considered the \"Most Outstanding\", with excellent ratings in all categories."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Since her Master cannot effectively provide her with Mana, she minimizes her activity to preserve her energy. Saber is frustrated by Shirou's \"protective\" tendencies, believing his erratic and reckless behavior will jeopardize her chances of winning the Holy Grail War."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c37815"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1d42ca3511b126be0db51185bcc475219ae5a5076d3bd68d122f01a5938e866b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a0/a027e63f0de4170d5e808094140e6557f702a05cdc05f707a2f96539a5c6c16f.webp","width":141,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c37816","characterName":"イリヤスフィール・フォン・アインツベルン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c37816"},"originalCharacterName":"イリヤスフィール・フォン・アインツベルン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"530"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"61"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"133"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"62"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"47"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"34"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young Teutonic aristocrat, she traveled to Japan to participate in the Holy Grail War as a Master. Illyasviel has an angelic appearance and an unsurpassed degree of magical power. Illyasviel asks those she feels comfortable around to simply call her \"Ilya\"."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She lives in a castle on the outskirts of Fuyuki City, accompanied only by her Servant and two maids."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c37816"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3d038e92db4ce4eb973e90fdb43433f9b3304e673c91f14c1d2297c35ed1d00c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/60/60bb7bcfe3a710b5e22bfbd6a59df27a8c836e67362758c22936dc48d5dcd489.webp","width":137,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c37817","characterName":"ライダー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c37817"},"originalCharacterName":"ライダー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"172"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":true,"text":"The servant of Matou Shinji."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rider is silent, sultry, and vigilant, never hesitating to shield her Master from harm."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"With her Master incapable of lending Mana to her, she is forced to seek alternative means to augment her abilities. To compensate for her weakness, Rider employs covert battle tactics and takes full advantage of territory around her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her weapon of choice is a pair of long iron nails fastened to opposite ends of a single chain, which she effectively thrusts from distances."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Rider's most notable ability is her mystic eyes of petrification, which can literally petrify ones with weak magic resistance and hamper others. Using her mystic eyes, Rider can fight much more efficiently. However, she almost always keeps them covered to hide her identity and to avoid harming her allies."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c37817"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c2/c27ea13256e7477e98d6038ad8b1b670c604c7fe663728ba7626d5291b449c1a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7fd85516618ad01e28b8e3f5324d2e88415cfd5cf2c763b9beced2501e06f882.webp","width":121,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c37818","characterName":"キャスター","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c37818"},"originalCharacterName":"キャスター","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"51"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b5/b513942bf1f3ebbfacd9c906b996830789429e191995e2a092900e52c2777a45.webp","fa